{title: EVERYTHING I DESIRE}
{artist: THE BROOKLYN TABERNACLE CHOIR}

{repeat: 2}
Thanana (en décalé) Tha-na-na-na tha-na-na-na ah
ah tha-na-na-na tha-na-na-na [×2]

[×2 You are my friend (Ameni Ameni)
Oh, You are my joy (Ameni Ameni)
You are my comforter (Ameni Ameni)
You are everything I desire (everything I desire)
When I feel (Ameni Ameni)
So sad and lonely (Ameni Ameni)
You are the first (Ameni Ameni)
On my mind (On my mind)]

{section: SOLO + (CHORALE) + TRADUCTION ANGLAIS}
Ungumngani wami (Thi tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // You are my friend
Ebumnandini (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // In joyful times
Ebunzimeni (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // In times of joy
Awuguquki (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // You never change
We Somandla (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // O, dear Lord
Ngiya abonga (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // I do thank you
Wen ababa (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // For you never change
Awuguquki (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na) // You stay the same

{section: SOLO + (CHORALE)}
