Call on Jesus (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na)
He's got the power (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na)
To lift you up! (thi, tha-na-na-na thi, tha-na-na-na)]

{section: Solo + (Chorale) + Traduction angalis}
